WEBVTT

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:26.550
So... So the incident at Qiongqi Road,

00:02:26.570 --> 00:02:28.660
the deaths of thousands of cultivators at Nightless City,

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:31.620
Jin Zixuan, and

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:33.600
my Shijie...

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:37.880
They did not result from you losing control to demonic cultivation,

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:42.280
but a scheme carefully devised by a mastermind.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:43.730
Who is it?!

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:11.510
Clan Leaders, we've found our Clan Leader.

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:19.200
Clan Leader Nie, have you been following us since we were at Xinglu Ridge?

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:21.260
It- It really wasn't me.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.480
Hanguang-Jun, I was just passing by Xinglu Ridge

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:27.110
when that Spiritual Dog pounced on me.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:30.110
I really didn't go anywhere else!

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.570
It's already so late, will you let me leave?

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:41.460
My fan! I thought I'd lost it.

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:45.570
Thank you so much, Hanguang-Jun! Where did you find it?

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:47.220
Outside the stone castle.

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:52.800
I... I was just following you and... this Young Master here.

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:56.420
I don't know about anything else.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:02.280
Since you said that you have no idea, I'll help you say it.

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:05.820
Let's see if you'll remember after listening.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:10.460
According to the legend of the Man-Eating Castle, anyone who trespasses

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:12.220
will be devoured without a trace.

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:14.600
Since there weren't any survivors,

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.770
how could anyone know that they were devoured?

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:21.110
Therefore, this fabricated story was circulated by someone.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:24.020
The maze array on Xinglu Ridge was very intricate.

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:26.480
Without a well-trained spiritual beast,

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:28.770
unless one had a level of skills like Hanguang-Jun's,

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:31.600
one would only wander in circles.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:33.710
As for the castle itself,

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:37.350
it is fully enclosed and sealed with a protective barrier.

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:40.530
Without high-quality magic tools, entry is impossible.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.370
The castle's legend, the maze array, and the protective barrier...

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:45.130
Three forms of protection.

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:48.150
Their purpose is to keep people away from Xinglu Ridge

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:51.280
and prevent the discovery of the castle's secret.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:52.950
An evil castle in the territory of Qinghe Nie,

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:56.440
a sabre interred alongside many corpses...

00:04:56.770 --> 00:05:00.880
Clan Leader Nie, if you don't explain yourself now,

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:06.730
when this scandal is exposed, no one will listen to your explanation.

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:13.060
Hanguang-Jun and this Young Master...

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:18.800
Can you swear that you will keep everything I say a secret?

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:20.860
As you wish.

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:22.930
What he said.

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:32.150
That... That isn't some Man-Eating Castle.

00:05:32.150 --> 00:05:34.200
That's my clan's Sabre Hall.

00:05:34.840 --> 00:05:36.260
Sabre Hall?

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:47.200
Clan Leader, we haven't found Mo Xuanyu or the Ghost General yet.

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:48.860
Keep searching!

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:53.280
If alive, bring them to me. If dead, bring me their corpse!

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:06.080
Hanguang-Jun... It's the middle of the night.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:08.680
Why are you going to my clan's Sabre Hall?

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.510
There is a matter at hand.

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:11.880
Clan Leader Nie,

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:15.950
why did your clan need to kill thousands as sacrifices for the sabres?

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.600
No! You're wrong!

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.660
Hanguang-Jun, let me explain!

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:21.840
We didn't cause the death of those corpses!

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:24.930
We spent a lot of effort to collect them!

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:28.150
Why did you gather them?

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:33.640
To suppress the aggressive sabre spirits.

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:35.400
Please explain.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:41.820
You know that the ancestor of our Qinghe Nie Clan was originally a butcher.

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:45.950
He was a sabre cultivator with a distinctively forceful style.

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:48.110
However, being overly rigid makes one snap easily.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.930
Past leaders of the Nie Clan

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:53.040
all met a sudden and bloody death from Qi deviation.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:57.280
Their sabres were all heavily influenced by their aggressiveness and killing intent.

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:01.550
No wonder you wield a fan instead of a sabre.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:04.770
The sabre spirit only deems one person as its master.

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:07.350
When its master is alive, it can still be restrained.

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:09.620
But once its master dies,

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:13.310
if it is not fed with fiends, it will cause trouble.

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:14.570
Oh, I get it.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.950
Since the sabre spirit wants to battle with fiends,

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:19.840
your ancestors buried feral zombies alongside the sabre coffins

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:21.440
so that they could fight with each other

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.370
and keep each other in check.

00:07:23.480 --> 00:07:24.880
Exactly.

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:27.420
The Sixth Clan Leader came up with this method,

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:30.200
which gave us peace for several hundred years.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:32.240
But about a decade ago,

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:34.200
a group of grave robbers found their way here.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:36.040
They heard about the stone castle

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:37.880
and somehow mistook our Sabre Hall

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:40.200
for a great tomb of enlightened immortals.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.950
Then they blasted their way into the castle.

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:45.600
It happened shortly after I succeeded as Clan Leader.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:47.400
I brought some men to investigate it.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:52.910
Strangely, the dozens of grave robbers had vanished into thin air.

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:55.770
How could they vanish into thin air?

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:57.510
They must have damaged the corpses

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:59.570
and destroyed the balance within the castle.

00:07:59.570 --> 00:08:04.130
So, the Sabre Hall had to trap them inside to fill the vacancies.

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:08.730
Young... Young Master Mo, you know quite a lot.

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:11.170
To prevent such incidents from happening again,

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.600
you spread the rumour of the Man-Eating Castle.

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:16.060
No. It started from the town.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:20.040
I merely exaggerated it a bit to prevent anyone from barging in.

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:23.040
But the tomb was sealed within the castle.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:25.530
Yet the bloodstains were found outside of it.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.170
What... what's wrong?

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:46.080
It's just like what happened ten years ago...

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:54.170
The bodies were dissolved.

00:08:56.280 --> 00:08:59.710
Those are... the robes of our clan!

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:02.130
Young Master Jin blew up a hole...

00:09:02.150 --> 00:09:06.280
so I sent disciples to find new corpses to fill it up.

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:15.200
Black clothed men?

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:22.710
The sacrificial warrior at Huaicang Hill belonged to this group?

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:24.220
We can't be certain yet.

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:27.240
You search inside the castle first. Leave them to me.

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:29.620
Be careful.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.930
I haven't warmed up to this flute yet.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:46.750
But it's more than enough for dealing with the lot of you.

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:48.770
Kill!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:03.150
Young Master Mo, you really are more capable than you look.

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:10.680
Young Master Mo, save me!

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:25.400
Second Brother! Third Brother!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.640
Huaisang, what happened?

00:10:27.820 --> 00:10:32.460
I... I really don't know anything this time.

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.370
Lan Zhan!

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:56.170
This person's cultivation base is weaker than Lan Zhan's.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:59.880
But he seems to be quite familiar with the Gusu Lan Clan's sword technique.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:12.860
Set up the array!

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:37.730
The scars of a caster of the Ulcerating Curse!

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:47.530
What is...?

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.770
Lan Zhan had already suppressed it. Why did it suddenly...?

00:11:55.970 --> 00:11:57.200
The ghost hand?!

00:11:57.680 --> 00:11:59.640
The Curse Mark responded to it.

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:03.150
The fiend that Jin Ling offended was related to the ghost hand!

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:23.240
You... you dug out so many corpses all at once.

00:12:23.370 --> 00:12:26.000
There won't be enough left to suppress the sabre spirit.

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:30.310
All their upper bodies have been checked. No missing left arm.

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:33.880
It shouldn't be. Maybe we dug at the wrong spot?

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:35.840
Jin Ling was buried right here.

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:40.400
When we came in, the black clothed men were also digging up corpses here.

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:50.910
Pardon me.

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:01.130
This is...

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:24.170
Young Master Mo, Wangji had expelled most of the Curse Mark from you.

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:27.600
With this pill, you will recover within half a month.

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.170
Thank you, Clan Leader Lan.

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:38.350
Don't worry too much, Huaisang.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:42.680
Your Second Brother and I will handle the problem here.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:45.310
Thank you, Third Brother.

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:49.730
This is my big brother's Sabre Hall. I didn't expect that...

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:53.400
Wangji, what do you plan to do next?

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:55.860
I will uncover the identity of the ghost hand's owner

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:58.460
and the culprit behind its dismemberment.

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:04.020
Those sacrificial warriors were well-trained and brutal.

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:07.440
We must solve this case to prevent further troubles.

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:11.000
Hanguang-Jun,the forces behind them are unpredictable.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:13.220
I will send more men to help you.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:16.680
Thank you, Clan Leader Jin. But I'm good for now.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:20.370
I will ask the Watch Towers for support if necessary.

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:22.530
All right.

00:14:22.970 --> 00:14:26.060
Xuanyu, I heard that you switched to demonic cultivation.

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:27.350
Although it is unorthodox,

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:29.950
you are on the right path if you use it to do good.

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:32.730
Go along with Hanguang-Jun and learn from him.

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:36.240
<i>He sounds like he knows Mo Xuanyu pretty well.</i>

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:39.530
<i>I should speak less to avoid making mistakes.</i>

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:40.480
Understood.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:43.510
Without further ado, we shall leave first.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:01.080
The legs were suppressed by both the sabre spirit and normal corpses.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:04.660
I might never have been able to find them if not for the Curse Mark.

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.710
He played his cards really well.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.770
Experiments were conducted in Huaicang Hill 11 years ago.

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:12.570
The next year, the Sabre Hall ran into trouble.

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:14.440
The timeline matches.

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:18.800
Those grave robbers must have ran into the sacrificial warriors.

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:21.420
Just like what happened to the Nie Clan disciples tonight,

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:24.910
their bodies had been melted, leaving behind pools of blood.

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:27.510
But more importantly...

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:35.150
That person has finally surfaced after 14 years.

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:42.420
That person is familiar with the sword technique of Gusu Lan Clan.

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:46.680
He even covered up his sword to keep us from recognizing it.

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:50.110
Lan Zhan, is he someone you might know?

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:51.860
No.

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:54.200
This is getting more complicated.

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:56.440
I've examined Wen Ning's memory before,

00:15:56.550 --> 00:16:00.400
where a disciple of Gusu Lan Clan appeared beside Jin Guangshan.

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:03.280
Do you think they are the same person?

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:05.000
Gusu Lan Clan?

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:06.970
Do you know who he is?

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:11.710
Not yet. But speaking of Jin Guangshan...

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:16.200
You mean Wen Ning didn't lose control in Nightless City?

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:20.040
Back then, Jin Guangshan was eager to kill you.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.970
But the Yunmeng Jiang Clan defended you.

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:24.600
My brother and Clan Leader Nie also thought that

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:27.170
the truth behind the Ulcerating Curse should be investigated first.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:31.000
Therefore, he used Wen Ning to drive a wedge between me and

00:16:31.060 --> 00:16:34.260
the Gusu Lan and Qinghe Nie clans.

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:37.770
Jin Guangshan was a shrewd schemer!

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:41.020
Then could he be the one who set up the Spirit Lure Array?

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:44.460
No evidence. But I wouldn't rule out the possibility.

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:46.550
No evidence...?

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:51.420
So many people wanted me dead. How can I tell who did it?

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:55.350
I shouldn't have been so conceited that I wouldn't even listen to <i>you</i>.

00:16:55.350 --> 00:16:58.840
That was why others were able to take advantage of me.

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:00.440
Wei Ying.

00:17:11.570 --> 00:17:13.040
You never intended for that to happen.

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:16.950
I know that you tried your best.

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:24.930
Right. Those mistakes had already been made. No use regretting anymore.

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:29.770
But thankfully, we still have clues.

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:31.460
In any case,

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:34.860
the mastermind behind the Forbidden Sacrificial Ritual that summoned me

00:17:34.880 --> 00:17:37.260
must know the truth behind everything.

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:46.600
If we uncover the identity of this ghost hand's owner,

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:49.840
perhaps the mystery will be solved.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:29.600
This direction is...

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:42.020
Removal of the Soul Expel Seal only helped us summon an incomplete soul

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:44.040
and it just pointed towards the West.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:46.400
That's such a broad range, how can we find anything?

00:18:46.400 --> 00:18:48.930
I will ask the souls along the way. We will eventually find it.

00:18:48.930 --> 00:18:51.570
Have you heard? Something happened in the Man-Eating Castle again!

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:54.820
Yes. This morning I saw many disciples

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.710
of the Lanling Jin and Gusu Lan Clans enter the ridge.

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.980
That Total Ignoramus from the Nie Clan must have asked for help again.

00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:01.950
Such a big commotion?

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:04.020
Has the Yiling Patriarch come back?

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:07.770
Why is it <i>my</i> fault again?

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:10.000
That's absurd.

00:19:10.150 --> 00:19:12.350
The Yiling Patriarch was killed by his legion of ghosts.

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:14.460
If he were still alive, he would've returned long ago.

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:15.570
Wei Ying.

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:19.040
There is one matter that I have yet to understand.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:22.060
Something that even the Hanguang-Jun can't understand?

00:19:22.710 --> 00:19:25.040
Quick! Tell me what it is.

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:30.280
It is widely believed that your legion of ghosts turned on you, causing your demise.

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:35.510
But from my findings on the Burial Mounds, that is not true.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:49.930
I died, that's all.

00:19:50.570 --> 00:19:54.040
It doesn't matter how I died.

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:55.800
Wei Ying.

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:57.350
Rattle-drum!

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:02.570
I really like this toy for some reason.

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:09.150
Lan Zhan, buy me one?

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:14.110
Sure.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:30.600
Dad, mum, and A-Xian.

00:22:52.280 --> 00:22:54.930
The Forbidden Sacrificial Ritual...

00:22:57.660 --> 00:22:59.600
Wei Wuxian...

00:23:07.200 --> 00:23:09.730
Lan Zhan, look! There's another one over here.

00:23:10.170 --> 00:23:13.550
He is not a feral zombie. He was killed by a single slash.

00:23:18.840 --> 00:23:21.130
The Frost Flower Sword-Cut?
